{"name": "s3", "dur": 45.9, "lines": [{"id": "z01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.31, "clip": 0.3, "text": "AI 芯片的新闻，", "ch": [0.35, 0.457, 0.563, 0.67, 0.777, 0.883, 0.99, 1.097, 1.203], "sub": null, "big": "AI 芯片的新闻，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "z02", "t0": 1.71, "t1": 3.08, "clip": 1.66, "text": "天天在说速度翻倍。", "ch": [1.71, 1.862, 2.014, 2.167, 2.319, 2.471, 2.623, 2.776, 2.928], "sub": null, "big": "天天在说速度翻倍。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "z03", "t0": 3.48, "t1": 6.74, "clip": 3.43, "text": "可这就像汽车说最高时速 300，没说是在什么路上跑的。", "ch": [3.48, 3.598, 3.715, 3.833, 3.95, 4.068, 4.185, 4.303, 4.42, 4.538, 4.655, 4.773, 4.891, 5.008, 5.126, 5.243, 5.361, 5.486, 5.612, 5.737, 5.862, 5.988, 6.113, 6.238, 6.364, 6.489, 6.615], "sub": "最高时速 300，在什么路上？", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "z04", "t0": 6.99, "t1": 8.93, "clip": 6.94, "text": "看懂这类新闻，先问三个问题。", "ch": [6.99, 7.121, 7.253, 7.384, 7.516, 7.647, 7.779, 8.06, 8.184, 8.309, 8.433, 8.557, 8.681, 8.806], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "z05", "t0": 9.38, "t1": 11.2, "clip": 9.31, "text": "第一问：在什么路上跑出来的？", "ch": [9.38, 9.502, 9.625, 9.747, 10.02, 10.138, 10.256, 10.374, 10.492, 10.61, 10.728, 10.846, 10.964, 11.082], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "z06", "t0": 11.45, "t1": 16.05, "clip": 11.4, "text": "同样写着 224G，一个能推过一米长的铜缆，一个只跑几厘米。", "ch": [11.45, 11.605, 11.76, 11.915, 12.07, 12.225, 12.38, 12.535, 12.69, 12.845, 13.15, 13.29, 13.43, 13.57, 13.71, 13.85, 13.99, 14.13, 14.27, 14.41, 14.55, 14.69, 15.01, 15.14, 15.27, 15.4, 15.53, 15.66, 15.79, 15.92], "sub": "同样 224G：一米，还是几厘米", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "z07", "t0": 16.3, "t1": 18.34, "clip": 16.24, "text": "路越长、损耗越大，越难跑。", "ch": [16.3, 16.453, 16.605, 16.758, 17.07, 17.212, 17.354, 17.496, 17.638, 17.92, 18.025, 18.13, 18.235], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "z08", "t0": 18.79, "t1": 21.21, "clip": 18.74, "text": "第二问：每传一个比特，花多少电？", "ch": [18.79, 18.905, 19.02, 19.135, 19.36, 19.52, 19.68, 19.84, 20.0, 20.16, 20.32, 20.62, 20.738, 20.856, 20.974, 21.092], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "z09", "t0": 21.46, "t1": 27.7, "clip": 21.39, "text": "要是每个比特的电降不下来，速度翻倍，耗电也跟着翻倍。几万颗芯片一起跑，每一点电都是成本。", "ch": [21.46, 21.602, 21.744, 21.885, 22.027, 22.169, 22.311, 22.453, 22.595, 22.736, 22.878, 23.02, 23.162, 23.304, 23.445, 23.587, 23.729, 23.871, 24.013, 24.155, 24.296, 24.438, 24.58, 24.722, 24.864, 25.005, 25.147, 25.289, 25.431, 25.573, 25.715, 25.856, 25.998, 26.14, 26.282, 26.424, 26.565, 26.707, 26.849, 26.991, 27.133, 27.275, 27.416, 27.558], "sub": "速度翻倍，耗电也可能翻倍", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "z10", "t0": 28.15, "t1": 30.4, "clip": 28.1, "text": "第三问：在真实芯片上跑通了吗？", "ch": [28.15, 28.287, 28.425, 28.562, 28.83, 28.973, 29.115, 29.258, 29.401, 29.544, 29.686, 29.829, 29.972, 30.115, 30.257], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "z11", "t0": 30.65, "t1": 34.87, "clip": 30.6, "text": "纸面和仿真里的速度，和真做出芯片、测出来的速度，是两回事。", "ch": [30.65, 30.796, 30.941, 31.087, 31.232, 31.378, 31.523, 31.669, 31.814, 31.96, 32.105, 32.251, 32.396, 32.542, 32.687, 32.833, 32.978, 33.124, 33.269, 33.415, 33.56, 33.706, 33.851, 33.997, 34.142, 34.288, 34.433, 34.579, 34.724], "sub": "仿真 ≠ 实测", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "z12", "t0": 35.32, "t1": 36.07, "clip": 35.26, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [35.32, 35.445, 35.57, 35.695, 35.82, 35.945], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "z13", "t0": 36.32, "t1": 40.83, "clip": 36.26, "text": "下次看到速度翻倍，先问三句：什么路？多少电？跑通没有？", "ch": [36.32, 36.487, 36.654, 36.821, 36.988, 37.155, 37.322, 37.489, 37.656, 37.823, 37.99, 38.157, 38.324, 38.491, 38.659, 38.826, 38.993, 39.16, 39.327, 39.494, 39.661, 39.828, 39.995, 40.162, 40.329, 40.496, 40.663], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "z14", "t0": 41.08, "t1": 44.3, "clip": 41.02, "text": "下一条：信号上路以后，为什么会越跑越模糊？", "ch": [41.08, 41.233, 41.387, 41.54, 41.693, 41.847, 42.0, 42.153, 42.307, 42.46, 42.613, 42.767, 42.92, 43.073, 43.227, 43.38, 43.533, 43.687, 43.84, 43.993, 44.147], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "news", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "z01", "t1": 9.08}, {"kind": "road", "t0": 9.08, "paper": false, "first": "z05", "t1": 18.49}, {"kind": "power", "t0": 18.49, "paper": false, "first": "z08", "t1": 27.85}, {"kind": "real", "t0": 27.85, "paper": false, "first": "z10", "t1": 35.02}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 35.02, "paper": true, "first": "z12", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "z12", "from": null, "to": null}, {"text": "看到「速度翻倍」，先问三句：", "line": "z13", "from": "下次", "to": "三句"}, {"text": "什么路？多少电？", "line": "z13", "from": "什么路", "to": "多少电"}, {"text": "跑通没有？", "line": "z13", "from": "跑通", "to": "没有"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 45.9}], "hudIn": 9.08}